  "description": "Reads and writes CSV, fixed-length and other flat file formats with a focus on schema definition, configuration and speed. Supports mapping directly between files and classes. A fork of FlatFiles by Travis Parks, continued for .NET 10; the assembly and namespaces are unchanged, so only the package reference differs.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
